{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1521298-wod-series-plan","id":1521298,"title":"WOD Series plan","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-23T17:35:42-07:00","id":1521298,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> WOD Series plan","content":"No, they didn't announce anything, just warning. I just thought to ask. Obviously WOD has the potential to make a tv series and streaming, paradox probably already has its plans for this, but I wanted to know if anyone here has thought about it, if the universe of WOD was to be introduced in a series how do you think it should be done?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-24T00:24:22-07:00","id":1521319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1521298-wod-series-plan#post1521298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Obviously WOD has the potential to make a tv series and streaming</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually?<br /> No<br /> Not anymore<br /> The Vampire-craze is long past its glory days<br /> And Werewoves never were<i> that</i> popular<br /> Wraith, Changeling and Mage is so niche, wouldn't last a season<br /> No one in the right mind would waste money on something that is basically doomed to fail<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1521298-wod-series-plan#post1521298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> how do you think it should be done?</div> </div> </div> </div>What We Do in the Shadows was the closest a WoD Vampire more or less would look like, it portrayed well how the vampires interacting with the modern world and other supernatural beings<br /> But the problem of RPG adaptations, while the session is interesting when you play it, when you are part of it, from the outsed as &quot;watcher&quot;?<br /> Not really. <br /> In theory either focusing on a Vampire Coterie, a Werewolf Pack, or team of Wraiths (do they even have an official name for that?) or any other superantural gang, could MAYBE work if they would start out us fledgelings/cubs/etc. to learn about the World of Darkness through their eyes but I think it would quickly ran out of steam<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-24T19:07:27-07:00","id":1521361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1521298-wod-series-plan#post1521298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, they didn't announce anything, just warning. I just thought to ask. Obviously WOD has the potential to make a tv series and streaming, paradox probably already has its plans for this, \u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>They\u2019ve been shopping it for a while. Since before the Sabbat book came out, since before Jenkins and Tate announced development on Scion and Exalted, likely before V5 was announced. Their plans are to license it out for someone to publish it. I suspect part of the reason Hunter: The Reckoning got a book before a splat people played is someone at ParaWolf thought it be easier to sell to a developer/producer than the others.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1521298-wod-series-plan#post1521298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026if the universe of WOD was to be introduced in a series how do you think it should be done?</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m dead serious when I say I want a return of Kindred: The Embraced. Not a reboot, season two showing how things have changed in the past 25 years. Give me Prince Daedalus vs Baron Sasha!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T12:44:14-07:00","id":1521525,"title":"","content":"If done right it could be really good, there used to be a british show about a ghost, werewolf, and a vampire trying to live together. it was actually pretty good<br /> <br /> but I could see something where the main character is either working for or &quot;infiltrating&quot; a pentex like corporation by working for them and most of the story is about how they try not to die to whatever critters pentex is creating or experimenting on","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T12:46:51-07:00","id":1521526,"title":"","content":"I think a Demon: the Fallen show would be good too if you could slide it through, the story revolves around a group of fallen dodging other supes and earthbound while trying to track down some ancient artifact or knowledge to bring back to their group","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.c